# Trivy suppressions for terraform-aws-s3-module.
# Every entry MUST have a justification. Review quarterly.
# Both the legacy (AVD-) and current IDs are listed for compatibility across Trivy versions.

# S3 server access logging is supported but optional (var.enable_access_logging);
# the target log bucket is owned by the consuming account/landing zone.
AVD-AWS-0089
AWS-0089

# SSE-S3 (AES256) is an explicitly supported encryption option (var.encryption_type);
# consumers that require a CMK select SSE-KMS or DSSE-KMS.
AVD-AWS-0132
AWS-0132
